@startuml
[*] --> ReceiveRequest

state ReceiveRequest
state IdentifyUser
state GatherVideos
state AddDetails
state SendVideos

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser : receive request from user
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : identify user who made request
GatherVideos --> AddDetails : gather different types of videos
AddDetails --> SendVideos : add additional details to suggested videos
SendVideos --> [*] : send suggested videos to user

@enduml
